# Per-developer local-dev overrides (see "Local Configuration Overrides" in
# local-dev/README.md). The *.local.yaml pattern is broad on purpose: never
# track a real secret anywhere under local-dev/, wherever a developer left the
# file. Neither pattern matches the committed *.example files.
local-dev/**/*.local.yaml
local-dev/apps/*/local/kustomization.yaml

